    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Under the null hypotheses (the marker is unlinked to a QTL), the $ d_{2i} $ are zero, while Equation 16.52 gives their values as functions of the QTL effects and distance from the marker if a QTL is linked to the marker. Note from Equation 16.52 that $ d_{2i} \\geq 0 $ under linkage.",
